<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - WorldCom cut to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - WorldCom cut to buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>--Hambrecht &amp; Quist analyst Joeseph Arsenio cut his recommendation on WorldCom Inc to buy from strong buy in light of the proposed buyout of MFS Communications Inc.</p>
<p>--cut fiscal 1997 earnings per share estimates to breakeven from $1.18.</p>
<p>--said the combination is a long-term positive but cuts near-term visibility and is very dilutive to EPS betweem 1997-99.  </p>
<p>--Shares of WorldCom were 5/8 higher at 21-1/8 in afternoon trading on Nasdaq.</p>
</text>
